This project derives material from the following upstream works. Licences are
stated as verified for the versions actually used; the SPDX-JSON SBOM attached to
each GitHub release names the complete dependency inventory of the released
binary.

| Upstream work | Licence | What is derived | Distribution |
|---|---|---|---|
| `caberdo/terraform-provider-trino` | MPL-2.0 | Repository scaffold, GNUmakefile targets, CI/release/coverage workflow configuration, `internal/*` package layout and test-layer patterns. No Go source file is copied verbatim. | Repository configuration and source patterns |
| `caberdo/terraform-provider-gravitino` | Apache-2.0 | CI, release and coverage workflow configuration only; no Go source code taken. | Repository configuration only |
| HashiCorp `terraform-provider-scaffolding-framework` | MPL-2.0 | Entry point (`main.go`) and the provider build/serve pattern. | Source and binary |
| HashiCorp Terraform plugin libraries | MPL-2.0 | `terraform-plugin-framework`, `-validators`, `-jsontypes`, `-go`, `-log` and `-testing` are compiled into the provider and its tests; `-docs` is build-time only. | Binary and build tooling |

